@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@ticketId = aaaaaaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaaaaaaaaaa
@token = replace-with-access-token
@categoryId = 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
@subcategoryId = 22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222
@queueId = 33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333

### Successful triage
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tickets/{{ticketId}}/triage
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
If-Match: "7"
Idempotency-Key: 2df4faae-9862-4ee6-bca0-a3b8a3455aa0
X-Correlation-Id: 21ae628b-f15d-47d1-a937-1be0f85d4cd1

{
  "categoryId": "{{categoryId}}",
  "subcategoryId": "{{subcategoryId}}",
  "priority": "HIGH",
  "supportQueueId": "{{queueId}}",
  "reason": "VPN access failure affects the requester's scheduled shift."
}

### Successful triage without subcategory
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tickets/{{ticketId}}/triage
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
If-Match: "7"
Idempotency-Key: 42a84f43-98aa-48d7-a261-3be3d81331e8

{
  "categoryId": "{{categoryId}}",
  "priority": "MEDIUM",
  "supportQueueId": "{{queueId}}",
  "reason": "Initial routing based on the reported access issue."
}

### Idempotent replay: send the first request again unchanged

